"answer": "Project Zenith is a high-priority initiative aimed at driving innovation, optimizing cloud storage, and enhancing data analytics. Key milestones include a $2M budget approval, a $500k allocation for Phase One, and a $55k increase for the compliance plan. The project involves multiple phases: Phase One kicked off in June/July 2023 with leaders Sarah Tan and Marcus Cole; Phase Two achieved a breakthrough in predictive analytics with a report due on November 20th. Other activities include a call for AI-driven data visualization ideas (due July 20th), successful completion of the testing phase (celebrated October 10th), and a request for prototype feedback by the end of November. Security protocols were updated for January implementation. The project contact email is contact@contact.com."
